1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:17,000
BenchEcho: quiet post-trial review.
Automated synthetic walkthrough; corrections use known scripts.

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Synthetic demonstration, not a real experiment.
Whisper runs locally and produces editable drafts—not trusted measurements.

3
00:00:41,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Review the recording, correct the draft, then confirm.
Trial identity is chosen before inference, never inferred from speech.

4
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Only confirmed observations enter the comparison.
Edit a note and it leaves the comparison until reviewed again.

5
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Export source filenames, hashes and reviewed versions.
Audio is not embedded: keep the matching original recordings.

6
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Quiet recordings only. Noisy tests produced wrong content.
Session is memory-only. No diagnosis or automatic pass/fail.
